          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A shadow is formed when light is blocked by an object.A shadow is formed when light is blocked by an object.A shadow is formed when light is blocked by an object. Opaque objects form darker shadows. Translucent objectsOpaque objects form darker shadows. Translucent objects make lighter shadows. Some transparent objects can create make lighter shadows. Some transparent objects can create faint shadows."
