            0.484
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The change in the direction of light by a mirror is calledThe change in the direction of light by a mirror is called reflection of light."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.488,
            0.727,
            0.544
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The image formed by a plane mirror is of the same size as the object, is erect, cannot be obtained on a screen, and is laterally inverted."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
